    "title": "Barlow baseball scores six in two innings to secure win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christopher Keizur ,\n23 hours ago After falling behind early, Barlow baseball showed some savvy hitting and resilient defense in a key non-league bout. The Bruins found daylight in the fifth inning against visiting Grant — the frame before they took their first lead of the night with a trio of scoring runs to make it 5-3. Then a single by junior Amari Reynolds knocked home junior Ryder Curtiss, and senior DJ Garcia and junior Ethan Baker both strolled across home plate after walks with the bases loaded. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
